# Bare apex → www canonical redirect (301).
# Canonical host is https://www.ecchips.com — all canonical tags, the
# sitemap and robots.txt point there.
#
# NOTE: this rule only fires once ecchips.com is attached to this Pages
# project (or intercepted by a Cloudflare edge Redirect Rule). Until then
# apex requests never reach this file — see DEPLOY-FIX.md step 1.
https://ecchips.com/*  https://www.ecchips.com/:splat  301
